{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1565035-babylon-city-of-monsters-kickstarter","id":1565035,"title":"\"Babylon: City of Monsters\" Kickstarter","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-10-29T08:00:22-07:00","id":1565035,"title":"\"Babylon: City of Monsters\" Kickstarter","content":"I am a longtime viewer of Jack Shen (Count Jackula) - a San Francisco artist, streamer, horror movie reviewer, and a fish in the local alt culture waters. I've appreciated hearing his perspective on life and art, since he's someone with a wildly different background to mine, and also someone with an overwhelming passion for horror. His reviews in the last days of ChannelAwesome's heyday showed me that I can do better with the content I watch.<br /> <br /> Just days ago, his first Kickstater came live, and I feel <i>personally</i> invested in seeing it succeed. The pitch is as follows:<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Babylon: City of Monsters is a tabletop role-playing game of monsters, magic, and mayhem. You play one of the NIGHTKIN, monsters who stalk unseen amongst humanity. Maybe you were once human, but were cursed to become something more and realized how right it felt. Or maybe you grew up feeling like an outcast, not understanding why you didn\u2019t fit in with the people around you, until the day you discovered you were never human to begin with.<br /> <br /> But who you were doesn\u2019t matter, because you\u2019ve left that all behind. It\u2019s all about who and what you are, baby\u2026 and baby, you are a beautiful, powerful, and downright badass creature of the night. And when they brought you to Babylon, you understood how it feels to come home to a place you\u2019ve never been.<br /> <br /> A place worth fighting for.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Before you click the link, be aware: although the content is similar thematically to that of World/Chronicles of Darkness or Curseborne, Babylon is <i>unabashedly</i> horny (compared to WoD/CofD's <i>classily</i> horny), so it might be best not to do it at work.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/babylongames/babylon-city-of-monsters\" target=\"_blank\">Kickstarter Link</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}